# No external ARINC dependency file is required.
#
# The offline build compiles TFTP, ARINC 665, and checksum code from the local
# source tree. Configure only the matching VxWorks Boost header location:
#
#   -DARINC_BOOST_INCLUDE_DIR=/absolute/path/containing/boost/version.hpp
#
# See VxWorksDKM.md for the complete VxWorks 26.03 DKM procedure.
